		<title>After midterm rout, OpenAI tries to win over communities it needs for AI expansion</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/after-midterm-rout-openai-tries-to-win-over-communities-it-needs-for-ai-expansion/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/after-midterm-rout-openai-tries-to-win-over-communities-it-needs-for-ai-expansion/#respond</comments>
		
